concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-10-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10(4) Establishment and appointment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-10-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Director-General holds office for a period of 5 years unless a shorter period is specified in the instrument of appointment. Note: The Director-General may be reappointed: see section 33AA of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
