concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-18 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18 Staff"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-18 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The staff of the Centre must be persons engaged under the Public Service Act 1999. (2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999: (a) the Director-General and the staff of the Centre together constitute a Statutory Agency; and (b) the Director-General is the Head of that Statutory Agency." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The staff of the Centre must be persons engaged under the Public Service Act 1999. (2) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999: (a) the Director-General and the staff of the Centre together constitute a Statutory Agency; and (b) the Director-General is the Head of that Statutory Agency."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "962c3feff7ae1a0aae6fe6a591a1d4b1b744c4238d1e3331277ad98f1065e381" ;
