concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-19 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19 Consultants"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-19 ;
    values:originalText "The Director-General may, on behalf of the Commonwealth, engage consultants to assist in the performance of the functions or duties, or the exercise of the powers, of one or more of the following: (a) the Centre; (b) the Director-General; (c) the Advisory Council.   The Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 2 Publication of public health advice  Division 5 Section 20 No. 61, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025" ;
    skos:definition "The Director-General may, on behalf of the Commonwealth, engage consultants to assist in the performance of the functions or duties, or the exercise of the powers, of one or more of the following: (a) the Centre; (b) the Director-General; (c) the Advisory Council.   The Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 2 Publication of public health advice  Division 5 Section 20 No. 61, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "33980bd40511eb68caac73e930e86eef7da9cdb22a4c21dd7144157777848219" ;
