concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-25 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "25 Simplified outline of this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-25 ;
    values:originalText "This Part establishes the Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control. The Advisory Council’s function is to provide advice to the Director-General on public health matters and other matters." ;
    skos:definition "This Part establishes the Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control. The Advisory Council’s function is to provide advice to the Director-General on public health matters and other matters."@en ;
