concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-27 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "27 Function of the Advisory Council"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-27 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The function of the Advisory Council is to provide advice to the Director-General on the following: (a) public health matters; (b) the Centre’s strategic direction and priorities; (c) any matter that will assist the performance of the Director-General’s functions or duties or the exercise of the Director-General’s powers under: (i) this Act; or (ii) the Biosecurity Act 2015; or (iii) the National Health Security Act 2007; or (iv) the National Occupational Respiratory Disease Registry Act 2023; (d) any other matter on which the Director-General requests, in writing, the Advisory Council to provide advice. (2) A request under paragraph (1)(d) is not a legislative instrument.   The Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 3 Membership of the Advisory Council  Division 3 Section 28 No. 61, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The function of the Advisory Council is to provide advice to the Director-General on the following: (a) public health matters; (b) the Centre’s strategic direction and priorities; (c) any matter that will assist the performance of the Director-General’s functions or duties or the exercise of the Director-General’s powers under: (i) this Act; or (ii) the Biosecurity Act 2015; or (iii) the National Health Security Act 2007; or (iv) the National Occupational Respiratory Disease Registry Act 2023; (d) any other matter on which the Director-General requests, in writing, the Advisory Council to provide advice. (2) A request under paragraph (1)(d) is not a legislative instrument.   The Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 3 Membership of the Advisory Council  Division 3 Section 28 No. 61, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "22051bbab2e38af936966f1c0851b1727ddf928228a582c530c7d2f6849bd774" ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-27-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-27-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
