concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-31 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "31 Publication of members of the Advisory Council"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-31 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Director-General must cause a list of all members of the Advisory Council to be published on the Centre’s website: (2) The rules may require or permit specified information (which may include personal information) about a member to be included in the list.   The Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 3 Administration  Division 4 Section 32 No. 61, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Director-General must cause a list of all members of the Advisory Council to be published on the Centre’s website: (2) The rules may require or permit specified information (which may include personal information) about a member to be included in the list.   The Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 3 Administration  Division 4 Section 32 No. 61, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4871fbadc18c46d85e5c2f2328d23bc0861b6b95e79e1089675317497f874aa4" ;
