doc:sec-31-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "31(2) Publication of members of the Advisory Council" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The rules may require or permit specified information (which may include personal information) about a member to be included in the list.   The Advisory Council of the Australian Centre for Disease Control  Part 3 Administration  Division 4 Section 32 No. 61, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025" ;
