    values:originalText "(7) As soon as practicable after a meeting, the Director-General must cause to be published on the Centre’s website a summary of any advice, or recommendations, relating to public health matters that the Advisory Council adopted during the meeting." ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer .

