doc:sec-41-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41(1) Prescribed public health entities" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Director-General may, by legislative instrument, specify entities that are prescribed public health entities for the purposes of this Act." ;
    cof:pageNumber "43"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-41-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41(2) Prescribed public health entities"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-41-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Director-General may specify an entity under subsection (1) only if the Director-General is satisfied that: (a) the entity: (i) has functions, duties or powers, under a law of the Commonwealth or a State or Territory, relating to prescribed public health activities; or (ii) carries out prescribed public health activities on behalf of the Commonwealth or a State or Territory; and" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Director-General may specify an entity under subsection (1) only if the Director-General is satisfied that: (a) the entity: (i) has functions, duties or powers, under a law of the Commonwealth or a State or Territory, relating to prescribed public health activities; or (ii) carries out prescribed public health activities on behalf of the Commonwealth or a State or Territory; and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f511115a97eab66fc17ac67eb351669619169d65edf12c12ab41a9db243333ea" ;
