concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-42 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "42 Designated data service provider"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-42 ;
    values:originalText "(1) In this Act, each of the following is a designated data service provider: (a) the Australian Bureau of Statistics; (b) the Australian Institute of Health and Welfare; (c) any other Australian government entity determined by the Director-General under subsection (2). (2) The Director-General may, by legislative instrument, determine for the purposes of paragraph (1)(c) that an Australian government entity is an designated data service provider.   Information  Part 4 Information-gathering powers  Division 2 Section 43 No. 61, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025" ;
    skos:definition "(1) In this Act, each of the following is a designated data service provider: (a) the Australian Bureau of Statistics; (b) the Australian Institute of Health and Welfare; (c) any other Australian government entity determined by the Director-General under subsection (2). (2) The Director-General may, by legislative instrument, determine for the purposes of paragraph (1)(c) that an Australian government entity is an designated data service provider.   Information  Part 4 Information-gathering powers  Division 2 Section 43 No. 61, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "955089baaa4799ae296fefa8c0c6068f3bcce9aeb10be505e3b62e862d9474f2" ;
