doc:sec-43-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "43(1) Request or agreement to give information" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Director-General may: (a) request, in writing, that an entity give specified information to the Director-General or a designated data service provider; or (b) enter into an agreement, in writing, with an entity for the entity to give specified information to the Director-General or a designated data service provider. Note: For specification by class, see subsection 33(3AB) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
