concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-52 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52 Authorisation—functions, duties and powers under the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-52 ;
    values:originalText "Biosecurity Act 2015 (1) A person (the discloser) may use or disclose relevant information in the course of or for the purpose of: (a) performing a function or duty, or exercising a power, under or in connection with the Biosecurity Act 2015; or (b) assisting another person to perform a function or duty, or exercise a power, under or in connection with the Biosecurity Act 2015. (2) The disclosure may include protected information if the person to whom the disclosure is made is:" ;
    skos:definition "Biosecurity Act 2015 (1) A person (the discloser) may use or disclose relevant information in the course of or for the purpose of: (a) performing a function or duty, or exercising a power, under or in connection with the Biosecurity Act 2015; or (b) assisting another person to perform a function or duty, or exercise a power, under or in connection with the Biosecurity Act 2015. (2) The disclosure may include protected information if the person to whom the disclosure is made is:"@en ;
