concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-55 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55 Authorisation—disclosure to Australian Bureau of Statistics and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-55 ;
    values:originalText "Australian Institute of Health and Welfare (1) The Director-General may disclose relevant information to the Australian Bureau of Statistics if the Director-General is satisfied that the information is relevant to the Bureau’s functions. (2) The Director-General may disclose relevant information to the Australian Institute of Health and Welfare if the Director-General is satisfied that the information is relevant to the Institute’s functions." ;
    skos:definition "Australian Institute of Health and Welfare (1) The Director-General may disclose relevant information to the Australian Bureau of Statistics if the Director-General is satisfied that the information is relevant to the Bureau’s functions. (2) The Director-General may disclose relevant information to the Australian Institute of Health and Welfare if the Director-General is satisfied that the information is relevant to the Institute’s functions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "32b64e18cb8fe6133c19b1f7db30c6f84c6590fc485f5afc525dd42c4903ddea" ;
    cof:pageNumber "54"^^xsd:integer ;
