concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-63 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "63 Authorisation—threats to safety, health or wellbeing"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-63 ;
    values:originalText "A person may use or disclose relevant information if the person reasonably believes that the use or disclosure is necessary for the purpose of preventing or lessening a serious threat to the safety, health or wellbeing of: (a) the public; or (b) one or more individuals." ;
    skos:definition "A person may use or disclose relevant information if the person reasonably believes that the use or disclosure is necessary for the purpose of preventing or lessening a serious threat to the safety, health or wellbeing of: (a) the public; or (b) one or more individuals."@en ;
