concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-66 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "66 Authorisation—use or disclosure by prescribed public health"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-66 ;
    values:originalText "entities (1) This section applies to a prescribed public health entity that has been given information under subsection 65(1) or (2). (2) The prescribed public health entity, and any person employed or engaged by the entity, may use or disclose the information if the use or disclosure is: (a) in the course of carrying out a prescribed public health activity specified in the undertaking for the purposes of subparagraph 65(4)(a)(iii); and (b) in accordance with the undertaking." ;
    skos:definition "entities (1) This section applies to a prescribed public health entity that has been given information under subsection 65(1) or (2). (2) The prescribed public health entity, and any person employed or engaged by the entity, may use or disclose the information if the use or disclosure is: (a) in the course of carrying out a prescribed public health activity specified in the undertaking for the purposes of subparagraph 65(4)(a)(iii); and (b) in accordance with the undertaking."@en ;
