concept:australian-centre-for-disease-control-act-2025-sec-73 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "73 Simplified outline of this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-73 ;
    values:originalText "This Part contains provisions about enforcement. In particular, this Part provides for how civil penalty provisions in this Act are enforceable under the Regulatory Powers Act.   Enforcement  Part 5 Civil penalties  Division 2 Section 74 No. 61, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025" ;
    skos:definition "This Part contains provisions about enforcement. In particular, this Part provides for how civil penalty provisions in this Act are enforceable under the Regulatory Powers Act.   Enforcement  Part 5 Civil penalties  Division 2 Section 74 No. 61, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025"@en ;
